## Run the unit tests

From the `modernisation-platform-environments` checkout, with the notifier's
Python test dependencies installed:

```sh
PYTHONPATH=terraform/environments/integration-hub-file-transfer/pull-from-presigned-url/lambda/notifier \
  python3 -m unittest discover -s terraform/environments/integration-hub-file-transfer/pull-from-presigned-url/lambda/notifier/tests -v
```

Unit tests do not establish live portal, group-isolation or Slack behaviour.
The [shared Python testing approach](python-unit-test-automation.html) is a
proposal, not an available workflow.
